<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia George Town 6-mth net up 70 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia George Town 6-mth net up 70 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to Sept 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   2.05   vs	   1.21</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)	  1.7    vs	   1.8</p>
<p>    Turnover		   140.08   vs	 131.93</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     3.62   vs	   2.14</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  0.15   vs  less   0.09</p>
<p>    Dividend			-     vs	    -</p>
<p>NOTE - George Town Holdings Bhd is involved in the operation of supermarkets and department stores, and the trading of pharmaceuticals.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
